WEBVTT

00:08:57.912 --> 00:09:03.412
I was taken back to my 12-year-old self
and my serious crush on him

00:09:03.412 --> 00:09:05.037
when I had seen him.

00:09:05.329 --> 00:09:06.954
Look at those curls.

00:09:06.954 --> 00:09:08.704
(Laughter)

00:09:08.704 --> 00:09:11.496
Chairman of the NAACP,

00:09:11.537 --> 00:09:14.329
he had been one of the student
leaders for SNCC,

00:09:14.371 --> 00:09:17.162
the Student Nonviolent
Coordinating Committee.

00:09:17.829 --> 00:09:20.912
At the tender age of 25,

00:09:20.954 --> 00:09:25.287
he had been elected to the Georgia
House of Representatives.

00:09:25.329 --> 00:09:27.871
Georgia being Georgia, then and now,

00:09:27.912 --> 00:09:31.496
and there being no Stacey Abrams in sight,